<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>LSP on NavyD 的个人博客</title><link>/tags/lsp/</link><description>Recent content in LSP on NavyD 的个人博客</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 02 Apr 2025 19:28:29 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="/tags/lsp/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>如何在 luals 中使用类型注释</title><link>/posts/2025/04/how-to-use-type-annotations-in-lua-language-server/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Apr 2025 14:51:47 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/2025/04/how-to-use-type-annotations-in-lua-language-server/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在使用
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/luals/lua-language-server"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;lua-language-server&lt;/a&gt;
对
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/openresty/lua-nginx-module"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;openresty/lua-nginx-module&lt;/a&gt;
编写 lua 程序时发现只有部分类型注释如 &lt;code&gt;ngx&lt;/code&gt; ，而需要 &lt;code&gt;require&lt;/code&gt; 加载的库如
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/openresty/lua-resty-core/blob/master/lib/ngx/balancer.md"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;ngx.balancer&lt;/a&gt;
,
&lt;a
class="link"
href="https://github.com/openresty/lua-upstream-nginx-module"
target="_blank"
rel="noopener"
&gt;ngx.upstream&lt;/a&gt;
的类型定义几乎不可用。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="分析"&gt;&lt;a href="#%e5%88%86%e6%9e%90" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;分析
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;下面是移除了注释后的类型文件
&lt;code&gt;~/.local/share/nvim/mason/packages/lua-language-server/libexec/meta/3rd/OpenResty/library/ngx/balancer.lua&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
